I have downloaded the DUNGEON games, VMS version, from the FTP.UU.NET archive,
in the directory /usenet/comp.sources.games/vmsnet.sources.games/dungeon.
  It is in 30 parts and after the decompression I found that the parts are not
in the right order. Before concatenating the files in one VMS_SHARE file you
need to change their names according the following table:

          1 -> 1             11 -> 10            21 -> 15
          2 -> 2             12 -> 11            22 -> 17
          3 -> 3             13 -> 12            23 -> 18
          4 -> 4             14 -> 13            24 -> 19
          5 -> 5             15 -> 14            25 -> 20
          6 -> 6             16 -> 21            26 -> 22
          7 -> 7             17 -> 23            27 -> 27
          8 -> 8             18 -> 24            28 -> 28
          9 -> 9             19 -> 25            29 -> 29
         10 -> 16            20 -> 26            30 -> 30

Then all will be fine. I hope that this will help.

